---
import "../styles/global.css";
---


<section class="about-icon-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>How Our Treks Are <span>More Than Just a Trek</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Every journey with us is carefully crafted for a deeply personal mountain experience.
    </p>

    <div class="about-row">
      <div class="icon-box gradient-blue">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" d="M3 20L12 4l9 16H3z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="text-box">
        <h3>Not Just a Trek — A Journey That Stays With You</h3>
        <p>
          Every trail we walk is a carefully chosen path into the heart of the Himalayas — not just to witness their grandeur, but to feel them under your skin and soul. Our treks are designed not as bucket list checkmarks, but as life-affirming journeys. At Planethimalayas, we believe a mountain journey is deeply personal — and that belief runs through everything we do.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-row reverse">
      <div class="icon-box gradient-pink">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" d="M12 21.35l-1.45-1.32C5.4 15.36 2 12.28 2 8.5
          2 6 4 4 6.5 4c1.74 0 3.41 1.01 4.22 2.61C11.09 5.01 12.76 4 14.5 4
          17 4 19 6 19 8.5c0 3.78-3.4 6.86-8.55 11.54L12 21.35z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="text-box">
        <h3>Individual Care, Every Step of the Way</h3>
        <p>
          We keep our groups small and intimate so we can focus on you — your pace, your concerns, your joy. From pre-trek guidance to trail-side support, our leaders walk with intention, offering safety and attention without intrusion. It’s this deep care that turns strangers into friends and walks into memories.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="about-row">
      <div class="icon-box gradient-green">
        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path fill="none" stroke="#fff" stroke-width="2" d="M12 20c4.418 0 8-3.582 8-8S16.418 4 12 4
          4 7.582 4 12s3.582 8 8 8zm0 0v-8l4-4"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="text-box">
        <h3>Built on Genuine Love for the Himalayas</h3>
        <p>
          We don’t just operate in the Himalayas — we live and breathe them. From respecting mountain communities to following Leave No Trace ethics, our treks are shaped by humility and care. With Planethimalayas, your trek becomes a way of giving back to the mountains that give us so much.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="section-separator"></div>

 <section class="why-choose-section">
  <div class="container">
    <h2>Why Choose <span>Us</span></h2>
    <p class="subtitle">
      Experience the difference of trekking with genuine mountain experts who truly care.
    </p>

    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card yellow">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="#ffb300" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2l3 7h7l-5.5 4.5L18 22l-6-4-6 4 1.5-8.5L2 9h7l3-7z"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Trek Leader & Guide</h3>
        <p>
          Led by certified mountaineers with wilderness first aid training, ensuring your safety and confidence at every step.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card purple">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="48" height="48" fill="none" stroke="#8b5cf6" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <!-- center person -->
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M5.5 21v-2a6.5 6.5 0 0113 0v2"/>
  
            <!-- left person -->
            <circle cx="5" cy="10" r="3"/>
            <path d="M2 21v-2a5 5 0 015-5h1"/>
  
            <!-- right person -->
            <circle cx="19" cy="10" r="3"/>
            <path d="M22 21v-2a5 5 0 00-5-5h-1"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Cook & Support Staff</h3>
        <p>
          Our mountain crew comprises local experts who bring unmatched experience, warmth, and deep knowledge of the region.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card blue">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="#3b82f6" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/>
            <path d="M5 21v-2a7 7 0 0114 0v2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Small Group Size</h3>
        <p>
          We cap our group departures at just 8 trekkers — ensuring individual attention, deeper connections, and better trail discipline.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card green">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="32" height="32" fill="none" stroke="#10b981" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5.25-3.5 10-8 10S4 17.25 4 12V6l8-4z"/>
            <path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Safety Standards</h3>
        <p>
          From camping to technical gear, we use only certified, high-altitude-tested equipment suited for extreme Himalayan conditions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card cyan">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="#06b6d4" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M21 10a9 9 0 11-9-9 9 9 0 019 9z"/>
            <path d="M12 6v6l4 2"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>24×7 Online Support</h3>
        <p>
          We're always available — before, during, or after your trek. Reach out anytime, and you'll always hear back from a real human.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feature-card emerald">
        <div class="icon">
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" stroke="#059669" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path d="M12 2a10 10 0 100 20 10 10 0 000-20zm0 0v5m0 5l3 3m-3-3l-3 3"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3>We Care for the Mountains</h3>
        <p>
          We strictly follow Leave No Trace ethics. Limited group sizes and mindful practices help protect the fragile Himalayan ecosystem.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


<style>
  .why-choose-section {
  background: #fff;
  color: #222;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
}



.why-choose-section h2 {
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  margin-top: 2rem;
}

.why-choose-section h2 span {
  color: #ff7300;
}

.why-choose-section .subtitle {
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  color: #666;
  margin-bottom: 60px;
}

.feature-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
  gap: 30px;
}

.feature-card {
  background: #fff;
  border-radius: 16px;
  padding: 40px 30px;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
  text-align: left;
  transition: all 0.4s ease;
}

.feature-card:hover {
  transform: translateY(-10px);
  box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(255, 115, 0, 0.25);
}

.feature-card .icon {
  width: 60px;
  height: 60px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  margin-bottom: 20px;
  border-radius: 12px;
  transition: all 0.4s ease;
}

.feature-card .icon svg {
  width: 40px;
  height: 40px;
  transition: all 0.3s ease;
}

/* ==== ICON GRADIENT STYLES ==== */
.feature-card.yellow .icon {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff3cd, #ffe082);
}
.feature-card.purple .icon {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ede9fe, #d8b4fe);
}
.feature-card.blue .icon {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #e0f2fe, #93c5fd);
}
.feature-card.green .icon {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1fae5, #6ee7b7);
}
.feature-card.cyan .icon {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cffafe, #67e8f9);
}
.feature-card.emerald .icon {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #d1fae5, #34d399);
}

.feature-card:hover .icon svg {
  transform: scale(1.15);
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 10px rgba(255, 115, 0, 0.6));
}

.feature-card h3 {
  font-size: 1.2rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
  color: #111;
}

.feature-card p {
  color: #555;
  line-height: 1.7;
  font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
}

/* About Section */
.about-icon-section {
  background: #ffffff; /* white background */
  color: #333;
  margin-top: 1rem;
  font-family: 'Helvetica', Arial, sans-serif;
}

                        

.about-icon-section h2 {
  
  font-size: 2rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.about-icon-section h2 span {
  color: #ff7300;
}

.about-icon-section .subtitle {
  
  color: #666;
  font-size: 1.1rem;
  margin-bottom: 60px;
}

.about-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: space-between;
  margin-bottom: 2rem;
  flex-wrap: wrap;
}

.about-row.reverse {
  flex-direction: row-reverse;
}

.icon-box {
  width: 160px;
  height: 160px;
  border-radius: 16px;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  transition: all 0.5s ease;
  box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
  perspective: 600px;
}

.icon-box svg {
  width: 80px;
  height: 80px;
  transition: all 0.5s ease;
}

/* Gradients */
.gradient-blue {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4a6cf7, #45b6fe);
}

.gradient-pink {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f05252, #ec4899);
}

.gradient-green {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #34d399);
}

/* 🌟 Hover Animation — Tilt + Glow in their own colors */
.gradient-blue:hover {
  transform: translateY(-10px) rotateY(12deg);
  box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(69, 182, 254, 0.8);
}

.gradient-pink:hover {
  transform: translateY(-10px) rotateY(-12deg);
  box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.8);
}

.gradient-green:hover {
  transform: translateY(-10px) rotateY(10deg);
  box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.8);
}

/* SVG glow */
.gradient-blue:hover svg {
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(69, 182, 254, 0.9));
}

.gradient-pink:hover svg {
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.9));
}

.gradient-green:hover svg {
  filter: drop-shadow(0 0 12px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.9));
}

.text-box {
  flex: 1;
  margin-left: 50px;
  max-width: 800px;
}

.about-row.reverse .text-box {
  margin-left: 0;
  margin-right: 50px;
}

.text-box h3 {
  font-size: 1.4rem;
  font-weight: 600;
  margin-bottom: 12px;
  color: #111;
}

.text-box p {
  color: #555;
  line-height: 1.7;
  font-family: 'Roboto', sans-serif;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .about-row,
  .about-row.reverse {
    flex-direction: column;
    
  }

  .text-box {
    margin: 30px 0 0 0;
  }

  .icon-box {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
}

.section-separator {
  width: 100%;
  height: 4px;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  margin: 0;
}

</style>
